Companion code and book for **__TOPIC__**, built one runnable stage at a time in **__LANGUAGE_LABEL__**.

## What this repository is

A staged build-along course. Each `chNN/` folder is a standalone checkpoint with its own run sheet, and the book explains the architecture, decisions, and failure modes behind each stage.

| Path | What it is |
|---|---|
| `ch00/` … `ch__LAST__/` | One runnable snapshot per chapter |
| `chNN/CHAPTER.md` | The chapter run sheet |
| `plan.md` | The concise stage contract |
| `book/BOOK.md` | The explainer book in Markdown |
| `book/BOOK.html` | Styled single-file HTML edition |
| `book/BOOK.pdf` | Print-ready PDF edition |
| `scripts/build.mjs` | Markdown → HTML → PDF builder |
| `assets/book.css` | The house stylesheet used by every HTML page |

Every chapter is a standalone __LANGUAGE_LABEL__ project.

