## Build the book

Requires Node.js 20+ and a local Chrome or Edge install for PDF output.

```bash
node scripts/build.mjs              # book + every chapter
node scripts/build.mjs --no-pdf     # HTML only
node scripts/build.mjs --book-only  # book only
```

Set `CHROME_PATH` if the browser is not in a standard location.

## Read the book

- Markdown: [`book/BOOK.md`](book/BOOK.md)
- HTML: [`book/BOOK.html`](book/BOOK.html)
- PDF: [`book/BOOK.pdf`](book/BOOK.pdf)

## Configuration

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` if the project needs secrets. Never commit a real key. The book and the offline docs should remain useful without credentials.

